{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f44a9978-2263-89ff-bdfa-21a15b6320a5",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T11:01:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:57:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Tony, Siobhan Hanlon. Bottom line, I think a payment on my water and sewer bill bounced from my bank and I want to know where it stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:57:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look at that. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:57:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "353 Ocean Avenue. It's a business account, on the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:57:33-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, give me a second to pull it up. [pause] Okay, I see the account. There's a payment posted on the twenty-second of December and then a reversal a few days later. That's usually a returned payment from the bank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:57:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's showing unpaid right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the balance is back on there as if the payment never came in. Nothing's been added that I can see, but the bill is still open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:58:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Can you email me a duplicate copy of the bill? I want to see exactly what's owed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:58:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure can. What email address do you want it sent to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:58:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the one you have on file, should be the business one. Can you read it back to me so I know it's the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:58:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can tell you it ends at the same company domain, but I'd rather not read the whole thing out over the phone. If it's the business address you're thinking of, does it start with your shop name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:58:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one. Send it there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I'll send the duplicate now. It should land in a few minutes, so check your junk folder if it doesn't show."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:58:56-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Now, the other thing. I'm leaving on a trip this afternoon and I'll be gone a couple of weeks. How do I pay it before I go without coming into City Hall? I'm not going to make it in before you close today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:59:14-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got a couple of options. You can pay online through the city's website using the account number off the bill, with a card or a bank account. Or if you'd rather, there's a drop box outside City Hall for checks, and it's available when the building's closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:59:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The online one works at night, weekends, all that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:59:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's up all hours. The only thing is, if it's a bank payment, make sure the account details are right, since that may be what tripped the last one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:59:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good point. I'll check the numbers when I get the email. Is there a phone option after hours too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T10:59:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's an automated payment line on the bill, I believe, but the online route is easier. Everything you need should be on the duplicate I'm sending."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll try to do it from my phone before I get to the airport. Sorry, hold on, I'm in the middle of fixing a squeaky hinge on the back door, let me put the screwdriver down. [pause] Okay, I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. A little oil usually does it, by the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got some, I'm just taking the pin out first. Anyway, will there be a late fee while the payment sits unpaid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't see a late charge on there at the moment. If one does get added, it'd show on the new bill. If you pay it today or over the weekend, you should be in good shape."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's what I needed. So the email's coming and I pay online today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. If anything looks off when you pay, call back Monday or after you're back and we'll sort it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Siobhan. Safe travels, and happy new year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
